      "en": "The angel took the censer, and he filled it with the fire of the altar, then threw it on the earth. Thunders, sounds, lightnings, and an earthquake followed.",
      "ko": "천사가 향로를 가지고 단 위의 불을 담아다가 땅에 쏟으매 뇌성과 음성과 번개와 지진이 나더라",
      "source_text_hash": "eb9e462c33a281912ccee4c639e1ac43446af86d57ceec2965f991ac07baf011",
      "translation_text_hash": "e11c5470c5ad8a35b8cf68a542cd5c60f434f84e6fbd6bfa315508e11adaeef6",
