      ],
      "en": "and one third of the living creatures which were in the sea died. One third of the ships were destroyed.",
      "ko": "바다 가운데 생명 가진 피조물들의 삼분의 일이 죽고 배들의 삼분의 일이 깨어지더라",
      "source_text_hash": "e6f4597b773638ec01ec933a176b94723118639f68cbac0007eac5eb62d0d04f",
      "translation_text_hash": "83e5de9cef5624ac77045a4fced8cf2817f186dae1fb2c9f2068787c10929657",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
